<title>FINLAND: AKTIA BANK TO CUT PRIME RATE TO 3.75 PCT.</title>
<headline>AKTIA BANK TO CUT PRIME RATE TO 3.75 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish bank Aktia Bank said in a statement on Wednesday it will lower its prime interest rate to 3.75 percent from 4.00 percent on November 18.</p>
<p>&quot;Aktia Bank has decided to lower Aktia Prime rate ... due to a fall in market interest rates and low inflation expectations,&quot; Aktia said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
